  "question": {
    "text": "It is given that the events \\(A\\) and \\(B\\) are such that \\(P(A)=\\frac{1}{4}, P(A \\mid B)=\\frac{1}{2} \\quad\\) and \\(\\quad P(B \\mid A)=\\frac{2}{3}\\). Then \\(P(B)\\) is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "dAIgx",
      "text": "\\(\\frac{1}{6}\\)",
      "image": null,
