  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(P(A)=1 / 4, P(A / B)=\\frac{1}{2}, P(B / A)=2 / 3\\)\nBy conditional probability,\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& P(A \\cap B)=P(A) P(B / A)=P(B) P(A / B) \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{4} \\times \\frac{2}{3}=P(B) \\times \\frac{1}{2} \\Rightarrow P(B)=\\frac{1}{3}\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
    "image": null
  },
